const togetherQuestions=['When plans change, what helps you most?','When there is tension, what matters first?','What makes quality time meaningful?','What do you need after a demanding day?','When sharing a goal, what matters most?','What helps you feel heard?','How do you celebrate a small win?','What makes a relationship feel safe?'];
const togetherOptions=[['A quick honest conversation','Time to adjust privately','An understanding gesture','A creative new idea'],['A direct conversation','A short pause','A little tenderness','A new way to look at it'],['Good conversation','Room to simply be','Small gestures and care','Doing something memorable'],['A chance to talk','Some quiet time','A sense of comfort','A change of scene'],['Shared clarity','Respect for individuality','Mutual encouragement','Room to experiment'],['Attentive questions','Patience and space','Empathy and kindness','Curiosity without judgment'],['Acknowledging the effort','Savoring it quietly','Sharing the moment','Planning something new'],['Honesty about needs','Room to be yourself','Consistency and warmth','Freedom to grow']];
